  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>C</mi></math> are the points of intersection of the parabola <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The perimeter (in units) of the triangle <math><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is the origin, is",
