  "solution": {
    "text": "On solving <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />we get,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;(as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is rejected because it makes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;not defined)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/38c2e908-4523-43ba-a4ee-210151a8ac3d.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.92014in;height:1.59375in\" /><br />Now, perimeter of <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units",
